  "_id": "3JmLP7nHSt7jkNNMKbynjIE7wTw",
  "_type": "Doc",
  "_index": "aC",
  "title": "ComboBox",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "A text input that filters a list of options."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3JmLP7DHk9ww4CZzAuetWnF34Il",
      "example": "ComboBox"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Groups and descriptions"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "groups-and-descriptions"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Group items under a label with ComboBoxGroup. Like SelectItem, a ComboBoxItem can show an `icon` and a `description` below its label. Values are strings or numbers: `onValueChange` receives the `value` of the picked item, typed like the `value` you pass."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3KdUIv2Nkori1pTzJySxWdQQlac",
      "example": "ComboBoxGroups"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Load items as you type"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "load-items-as-you-type"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "To search on a server, pass `filter={false}` so every item you render is shown, and `loading` while a request runs: it shows a spinner in the input, and in the list while it is empty. `useAsyncList` loads the items for the text in the input and cancels a request when a newer one replaces it. A function as `filter` replaces the default matching instead: `(textValue, inputValue) => boolean`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "ComponentExampleBlock",
      "_id": "3KdUIsKQGbfL2lswmYt4k9DakdU",
      "example": "ComboBoxAsync"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
